msgid "Module sources pinned by tag or digest."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-modules.md
msgid "A naming module that produces `<type>-<project>-<environment>-<region>-<instance>`, with a compact form for resources that don't allow hyphens, along with the standard set of tags."
msgstr ""

